    "description": "<p>No one ever said life was fair. Whether he picks it up or kicks it up, the character sends Essence-charged dirt, sand, dust or grime into the eyes of his opponent. Count only half of the target's Dodge DV against this attack (it cannot be parried). On a successful assault, the filth completely blinds the target temporarily, forcing a -4 internal penalty on him for his next three actions. Some martial artists use this Charm to provide an opportunity to get in some unseen blows. Others use the chance to escape or conceal themselves.</p>",
